  m_Name: Content_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9709e1cdb23fa419990d29f684126c4e, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 153544024064
    m_Localized: Big Roly-Poly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412672
    m_Localized: Medicine ball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412673
    m_Localized: Heavy and slow. Hits harder and knocks down everyone around the
      target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412674
    m_Localized: Tennis balls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412675
    m_Localized: Fly in a fan of three. The extra ones vanish when they touch the
      asphalt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412676
    m_Localized: Volleyball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412677
    m_Localized: After a hit, bounces on into two more enemies in a row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412678
    m_Localized: Boomerang
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412679
    m_Localized: The ball turns around mid-flight and flies back to your hands, knocking
      down everyone on the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412680
    m_Localized: On a rubber band
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153552412681
    m_Localized: A dropped ball jumps back into your hands by itself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606976
    m_Localized: One more ball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606977
    m_Localized: +1 ball in your hands and in reserve. Up to three times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606978
    m_Localized: Split
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606979
    m_Localized: On the first hit the ball splits in two and keeps flying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606980
    m_Localized: Sticky hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606981
    m_Localized: Catch window 35% longer, and you catch a bit farther. Up to three
      times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606982
    m_Localized: Long arms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606983
    m_Localized: Pick up balls from one and a half times farther. Up to two times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606984
    m_Localized: New sneakers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606985
    m_Localized: Run 12% faster. Up to three times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606986
    m_Localized: Sandwich
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 153556606987
    m_Localized: +1 life. Grandma sent it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928708784128
    m_Localized: Bouncy ball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978432
    m_Localized: After touching the asphalt, the ball hops up and flies dangerous
      again. Up to two times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978433
    m_Localized: Hot potato
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978434
    m_Localized: After a catch, your next throw explodes and hits everyone around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978435
    m_Localized: Bubble gum
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978436
    m_Localized: The ball leaves a sticky pink trail. Enemies get stuck in it and
      slow down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978437
    m_Localized: Slide tackle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978438
    m_Localized: Your dash knocks enemies off their feet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978439
    m_Localized: Hooliganism
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978440
    m_Localized: +1 damage to every throw, but one ball fewer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978441
    m_Localized: Freeze!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978442
    m_Localized: Every successful catch slows everything around for a second.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978443
    m_Localized: Deflated ball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23928712978444
    m_Localized: Wobbles like a snake and grazes every enemy near its path. No sky
      catches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133956933509120
    m_Localized: Off the wall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133956933509121
    m_Localized: Every wall bounce adds +1 damage to the throw. Up to two times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133956933509122
    m_Localized: Slingshot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133956933509123
    m_Localized: A charged throw pierces through every enemy and keeps flying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133956933509124
    m_Localized: Eagle eye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133956933509125
    m_Localized: The ball curves toward the nearest enemy ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133956933509126
    m_Localized: Domino
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133956933509127
    m_Localized: A knocked-out enemy falls onto its neighbours and knocks them over,
      all down the line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133956933509128
    m_Localized: Piggy bank
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133956933509129
    m_Localized: 'At the newsstand: +1 coin for every 10 you carry. Up to two times.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133956933509130
    m_Localized: Pot lid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133956933509131
    m_Localized: Blocks one hit or ball every 20 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133956933509132
    m_Localized: Yo-yo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133956933509133
    m_Localized: Boomerang + Rubber band. After a hit the ball snaps back to your
      hands, knocking down everyone on the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562260721664
    m_Localized: Jump rope
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915968
    m_Localized: Dash 30% farther, and it recharges faster. Up to three times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915969
    m_Localized: Pocket mirror
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915970
    m_Localized: Mannequins freeze even when they are right behind you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915971
    m_Localized: Flashlight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915972
    m_Localized: A wider circle of light around you in the dark. In it, shadows turn
      solid and can be hit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915973
    m_Localized: Whistle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915974
    m_Localized: A perfect catch freezes the enemies around you for a second and
      a half.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915975
    m_Localized: Second wind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915976
    m_Localized: Once per walk, a hit that would knock you out leaves you with one
      heart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915977
    m_Localized: Grandma's pies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915978
    m_Localized: +1 heart at the start of every next arena.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915979
    m_Localized: Rubber boots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915980
    m_Localized: Sand and puddles don't slow you down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915981
    m_Localized: Bouncing bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915982
    m_Localized: Hot potato + Bouncy ball. Every time the ball bounces off the asphalt,
      it explodes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915983
    m_Localized: Hailstorm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915984
    m_Localized: Tennis balls + Split. The fan balls and the twins split on a hit
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915985
    m_Localized: Kettlebell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915986
    m_Localized: Medicine ball + Hooliganism. The area hit stuns everyone it touches
      for a second.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915987
    m_Localized: Roll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915988
    m_Localized: Slide tackle + Jump rope. Dashing through an enemy ball catches
      it, even a strong one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915989
    m_Localized: Cheat sheet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915990
    m_Localized: At every newsstand, the first reroll is free.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915991
    m_Localized: Lucky wrapper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915992
    m_Localized: School bags and bosses offer four cards to choose from.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194562264915993
    m_Localized: PE Teacher Mannequin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 377579491024896
    m_Localized: The One in the Dusk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
